<BaseLayout title="Website Terms | Hustle & Rise" description="Terms covering appropriate use of Hustle & Rise content, job listings, training information, and third-party links.">
  <section class="legal-page px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-4xl prose-headings:font-brand prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-[#172033] prose-p:text-[#566071] prose-p:leading-8 prose-li:text-[#566071]"><p class="section-eyebrow">Trust & transparency</p><h1>Website terms</h1><p><strong>Last updated: 16 August 2026</strong></p><h2>Using the website</h2><p>By using Hustle & Rise, you agree to use it lawfully and not interfere with its security, availability, content, or other visitors. Do not attempt unauthorised access, distribute malicious code, or copy substantial content for automated republication.</p><h2>Educational information</h2><p>Content is general information, not personalised professional advice. You remain responsible for checking information and making decisions appropriate to your circumstances. See the <a href="/disclaimer">full disclaimer</a>.</p><h2>Job listings and applications</h2><p>Third-party employers and providers control job details and application processes. A listing may change or close without notice. Verify the original source before applying and never pay an employer merely to submit a job application.</p><h2>Training information</h2><p>Planned classes do not represent confirmed enrolment availability. Any future paid enrolment will be governed by the specific price, schedule, cancellation, and delivery terms presented before purchase.</p><h2>Intellectual property</h2><p>Unless stated otherwise, original Hustle & Rise text, design, and branding may not be reproduced commercially without permission. Short quotations and links may be used where lawful and appropriately attributed.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>External links are provided for convenience and attribution. Third-party services have their own terms, availability, and security practices. Hustle & Rise is not responsible for changes made by those providers.</p><h2>Availability and changes</h2><p>We may correct, update, move, or remove content and features. We do not guarantee uninterrupted availability, but we aim to correct material errors brought to our attention.</p><h2>Mandatory rights</h2><p>Nothing in these terms excludes rights or responsibilities that cannot lawfully be excluded. These terms should be read alongside laws that apply to the website operator and visitor.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
